         <item row="4" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="label_loadWithDicom">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Load the image volume with Slicer's DICOM module (scalar volume plugin) from the reconstructed DICOM files instead of building it directly. The DICOM reader applies the rescale slope/intercept of the headers and, if the slice positions are irregular (non-uniform spacing, in-plane shifts), adds an acquisition transform that puts every slice at its true position. Recommended when geometry issues are reported. Slower, and the image is written to a temporary folder while loading.</string>
           </property>
           <property name="text">
            <string>Load image using DICOM module:</string>
           </property>
           <property name="indent">
